{"id":"cue-0-0","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":0,"source_end_seconds":2.22,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.22,"text":"有人问为什么老虎在听到大象名敌后"}
{"id":"cue-1-2220","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":2.22,"source_end_seconds":3.7,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.48,"text":"第一时间趴在草叢里失落"}
{"id":"cue-2-3700","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":3.7,"source_end_seconds":5.64,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.94,"text":"等待大象穿过后才敢起身离开"}
{"id":"cue-3-5640","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":5.64,"source_end_seconds":7.54,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.9,"text":"而这只老虎准备狩猎眼前的大象"}
{"id":"cue-4-7540","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":7.54,"source_end_seconds":9.4,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.86,"text":"敌进后才发现体形太过庞大"}
{"id":"cue-5-9400","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-5-9400","source_start_seconds":9.4,"source_end_seconds":10.44,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.04,"text":"只能被迫逃走"}
{"id":"cue-6-10440","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-5-9400","source_start_seconds":10.44,"source_end_seconds":11.86,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.42,"text":"这才是寿亡该有的智慧"}
{"id":"cue-7-11860","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-5-9400","source_start_seconds":11.86,"source_end_seconds":12.62,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.76,"text":"那有人不服了"}
{"id":"cue-8-12620","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-5-9400","source_start_seconds":12.62,"source_end_seconds":14.32,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.7,"text":"这不是直接冲过来就袭击吗"}
{"id":"cue-9-14320","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-5-9400","source_start_seconds":14.32,"source_end_seconds":15.98,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.66,"text":"其实老虎针对的只是两角兽"}
{"id":"cue-10-15980","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-5-9400","source_start_seconds":15.98,"source_end_seconds":17.24,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.26,"text":"但凡当时没带真理"}
{"id":"cue-11-17240","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-11-17240","source_start_seconds":17.24,"source_end_seconds":18.3,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.06,"text":"哪怕坐在大象上"}
{"id":"cue-12-18300","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-11-17240","source_start_seconds":18.3,"source_end_seconds":20.16,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.86,"text":"老虎也想尝尝两角兽的闲弹"}
{"id":"cue-13-20160","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-11-17240","source_start_seconds":20.16,"source_end_seconds":21.04,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.88,"text":"只是实力相当"}
{"id":"cue-14-21040","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-11-17240","source_start_seconds":21.04,"source_end_seconds":21.9,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.86,"text":"没必要厮杀"}
{"id":"cue-15-21900","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-11-17240","source_start_seconds":21.9,"source_end_seconds":23.12,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.22,"text":"老虎虽然肯不下大象"}
{"id":"cue-16-23120","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-11-17240","source_start_seconds":23.12,"source_end_seconds":24.24,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.12,"text":"但也根本不惧怕"}
{"id":"cue-17-24240","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-17-24240","source_start_seconds":24.24,"source_end_seconds":26.38,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.14,"text":"而独居的老虎显然更喜欢偷袭"}
{"id":"cue-18-26380","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-17-24240","source_start_seconds":26.38,"source_end_seconds":27.72,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.34,"text":"务必做到一击必杀"}
{"id":"cue-19-27720","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-19-27720","source_start_seconds":27.72,"source_end_seconds":28.86,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.14,"text":"一旦遇到体形更大"}
{"id":"cue-20-28860","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-19-27720","source_start_seconds":28.86,"source_end_seconds":29.84,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.98,"text":"实力难变的猎物"}
{"id":"cue-21-29840","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-19-27720","source_start_seconds":29.84,"source_end_seconds":31.38,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.54,"text":"放弃离开才是最佳选择"}
{"id":"cue-22-31380","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-19-27720","source_start_seconds":31.38,"source_end_seconds":32.86,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.48,"text":"就算是已经到手的白只野牛"}
{"id":"cue-23-32860","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-19-27720","source_start_seconds":32.86,"source_end_seconds":34.44,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.58,"text":"甚至已经成功索侯的情况下"}
{"id":"cue-24-34440","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-19-27720","source_start_seconds":34.44,"source_end_seconds":35.7,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.26,"text":"意外冲出来另外一头"}
{"id":"cue-25-35700","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-25-35700","source_start_seconds":35.7,"source_end_seconds":36.98,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.28,"text":"老虎也能直接放弃"}
{"id":"cue-26-36980","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-25-35700","source_start_seconds":36.98,"source_end_seconds":37.94,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.96,"text":"没有一丝有余"}
{"id":"cue-27-37940","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-25-35700","source_start_seconds":37.94,"source_end_seconds":39.2,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.26,"text":"反观狮子到手的猎物"}
{"id":"cue-28-39200","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-25-35700","source_start_seconds":39.2,"source_end_seconds":40.62,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.42,"text":"面对成年场景路的踩踏"}
{"id":"cue-29-40620","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-25-35700","source_start_seconds":40.62,"source_end_seconds":41.36,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.74,"text":"不闪不避"}
{"id":"cue-30-41360","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-25-35700","source_start_seconds":41.36,"source_end_seconds":42.94,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.58,"text":"宁愿受伤也舍不得放弃"}
{"id":"cue-31-42940","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-31-42940","source_start_seconds":42.94,"source_end_seconds":44.16,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.22,"text":"而且还偏偏不信邪"}
{"id":"cue-32-44160","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-31-42940","source_start_seconds":44.16,"source_end_seconds":46.24,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.08,"text":"单枪匹马去捕杀狂暴的犀牛"}
{"id":"cue-33-46240","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-31-42940","source_start_seconds":46.24,"source_end_seconds":47.74,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.5,"text":"结果差点就被顶到肚子"}
{"id":"cue-34-47740","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-31-42940","source_start_seconds":47.74,"source_end_seconds":49.08,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.34,"text":"甚至招惹暴躁的河马"}
{"id":"cue-35-49080","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-31-42940","source_start_seconds":49.08,"source_end_seconds":50.72,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.64,"text":"最后被河马一口一个狮子头"}
{"id":"cue-36-50720","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-31-42940","source_start_seconds":50.72,"source_end_seconds":52.48,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.76,"text":"所以狮子明显没有老虎睿智"}
[/FULL_SOURCE_LEDGER_JSONL]
